---
// FinalCTA.astro — Última oportunidad para descargar
---

<section class="final-cta">
  <div class="cta-container">
    <div class="cta-content">
      <h2 class="title">¿Listo para transformar tu WhatsApp en una máquina de ventas?</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Descarga la guía gratuita ahora y empieza a aplicar el sistema hoy mismo. Sin pasos complicados, solo resultados.</p>
      
      <div class="action-box">
        <a href="#" class="btn-primary">Descargar guía gratis →</a>
        <p class="trust-text">Únete a +1,000 dueños de tiendas que ya lo están usando.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final-cta {
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 10rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--violet-deep);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .cta-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--violet-dark) 0%, #2D0A6E 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(169, 110, 255, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 5rem 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }

  /* Efectos de luz de fondo */
  .cta-container::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -20%;
    right: -10%;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 107, 91, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cta-container::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -20%;
    left: -10%;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 240, 160, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cta-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--violet-bright);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .action-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--yellow-pastel);
    color: var(--violet-deep);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 1.2rem 2.8rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 240, 160, 0.2);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.05);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(255, 240, 160, 0.3);
    color: var(--violet-deep);
  }

  .trust-text {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--violet-mid);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cta-container {
      padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    }
    
    .btn-primary {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
